<title>FRANCE: Reuters tenth ex-Paris air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters tenth ex-Paris air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are current average ex-Paris French franc air cargo rates per kilo for a 100 kg shipment with volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-on.</p>
<p>				  Jan 8     Nov 18</p>
<p>			NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p> PAR-JFK			 5.40	5.35</p>
<p> PAR-CHI			 5.75	5.75</p>
<p> PAR-LAX			 6.55	6.55</p>
<p> PAR-YMX (MONTREAL)	  6.65	6.65</p>
<p>			ASIA/PACIFIC</p>
<p> PAR-SEL			11.30     11.30</p>
<p> PAR-NAR			15.00     14.50</p>
<p> PAR-TPE			 8.00	7.80</p>
<p> PAR-HKG			 8.50	8.40</p>
<p> PAR-SIN			 8.20	8.20</p>
<p> PAR-NOU(New Caledonia)   40.15     39.95</p>
<p> PAR-PPT(Tahiti)	    33.60     33.35</p>
<p>		     MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> PAR-DXB			 5.25	5.25</p>
<p>		     INDIAN OCEAN</p>
<p> PAR-RUN (Reunion)	  21.30     21.30</p>
<p>		     FRENCH WEST INDIES</p>
<p> PAR/FDF/PTP		  15.00     15.00</p>
<p>		     AFRICA</p>
<p> PAR-JNB			14.10     14.10</p>
<p>The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller cargo agents based at the Paris airports.</p>
<p>All prices are quoted in French francs.</p>
<p>The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
